<title>POLAND: KPW clears BWR 1.7-million-share issue.</title>
<headline>KPW clears BWR 1.7-million-share issue.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Polish Securities Commission (KPW) has cleared for public trade a new issue of 1,671,915 shares in Bank Wspolpracy Regionalnej SA earmarked for four investors, the KPW said in a statement on Thursday.</p>
<p>It said 1,181,102 shares would be offered to fuel distributor  CPN SA, 404,199 to steel mill Huta Senzimira SA and 86,614 shares to two individual investors.</p>
<p>It said the shares would be paid for with real estate and that the four investors could subscribe from March 21 to June 20.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
